1383838,ca.proc.d.1945-10-03.11.1,1945-10-03,85a45525-d20a-41db-8c2a-1b91c360656b,ca.m.7972,Mr. COLDWELL:,,DISALLOWANCE OF PROVINCIAL LEGISLATION- ALBERTA,,,For a copy of all reports of the Minister of Justice recommending disallowance of, (a) an act to amend the Limitation of Actions Act, 1935 (Alberta), disallowed March 25, 1939 (P.C. 676); (b) an act to amend the Limitation of Actions Act, 1935 (Alberta), disallowed October 4, 1939 (P.C, 2949);
